# Portal Member Entitlements BFF — Contract

**Decision:** DL-09, DL-17, DL-21  
**Phase:** PS-5 / BP-5  
**Route:** `GET /api/me/entitlements`  
**Implementation status:** **PS-6 partial (2026-07-05)** — tier-based default grants, membership `portalModuleGrants`, BFF 30s private cache (DL-17); plan tables / webhooks deferred to BP-7.

---

## 1. API ownership

| Layer | Owner | Responsibility |
| ----- | ----- | -------------- |
| Portal BFF | `apps/portal` | Session cookie → headers; JSON shape; cache headers |
| API upstream | `apps/api` | Authoritative entitlement computation; RLS |
| Shell SSR | Platform portal shell | `navModules = registry ∩ entitlements.granted` |
| Workspace | Manifest only | Declares entitlement keys — never evaluates |

**Not chosen (DL-09):** JWT embed; client-only gating.

---

## 2. Request

```http
GET /api/me/entitlements HTTP/1.1
Host: {club}.portal.{root}
Cookie: atour_mb_session=...
```

**Headers (BFF → API):** Same as existing `/api/me/profile` — `Authorization`, `x-tenant-id`, `x-workspace-id` per [platform-portal-member.mdoc](./platform-portal-member.mdoc).

---

## 3. Response schema (conceptual)

```typescript
/** Documentation types — not shipped code */
type MemberEntitlementsResponse = {
  ok: true;
  tenantId: string;
  workspaceId: string;
  evaluatedAt: string; // ISO-8601
  granted: string[];   // e.g. ["member.module.trips", "member.module.profile"]
  denied: Array<{
    key: string;
    reason: "not_entitled" | "module_disabled" | "plan_limit";
  }>;
};
```

### 3.1 Entitlement key format

| Pattern | Example | Source |
| ------- | ------- | ------ |
| `member.module.{moduleId}` | `member.module.trips` | Registry module id |
| Platform-owned modules | `member.module.home` | Platform grants — workspace cannot declare `home` (DL-30) |

**Shell rule:** Module appears in nav iff registry lists it **and** `member.module.{id}` ∈ `granted`.

### 3.2 Default grant policy (PS-6 / DL-09)

Authoritative evaluation lives in `@app-tour/workspace-sdk` — **`evaluateMemberPortalEntitlements(pluginId, { explicitModuleIds })`**.

| `nav.tier` | Default grant | Denial reason when absent from `granted` |
| ---------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| `primary` | yes | `not_entitled` |
| `secondary` | yes | `not_entitled` |
| `user_menu` | yes | `not_entitled` |
| `hidden` | **no** — requires explicit grant | `plan_limit` |

**Explicit grants:** API reads optional `membershipMetadata.portalModuleGrants` (module ids, e.g. `["wallet"]`). Keys are merged: `defaultGranted ∪ explicitModuleIds→keys`. **Denali reference (PS-6):** manifest declares hidden `wallet` at `/me/wallet` — default members receive `denied: [{ key: "member.module.wallet", reason: "plan_limit" }]` until `portalModuleGrants` includes `"wallet"`.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Registry["resolveMemberPortalModules"]
  Meta["membershipMetadata.portalModuleGrants"]
  Eval["evaluateMemberPortalEntitlements"]
  Registry --> Eval
  Meta --> Eval
  Eval --> Granted["granted[]"]
  Eval --> Denied["denied[]"]
```

### 3.3 Runtime wiring (2026-07-05)

**Portal BFF** proxies `GET /identity/me/entitlements` when API upstream is reachable; falls back to local evaluator (same SDK function, empty explicit grants) when upstream unreachable.

| Layer | Behavior |
| ----- | -------- |
| API upstream | Loads membership metadata → `evaluateMemberPortalEntitlements` |
| Portal BFF | `fetchMemberEntitlementsUpstream` → cache → `resolveMemberEntitlementsPayload` |
| `denied` | `registry − granted` with tier-aware reasons |
| Cache | In-memory private TTL **30s max** (`MEMBER_ENTITLEMENTS_BFF_CACHE_TTL_MS`; `0` disables) |
| Shell SSR | **`resolveMemberEntitlementsForShell`** — same payload path as BFF GET |

**Paths:** `packages/workspace-sdk/src/portal/evaluate-member-portal-entitlements.ts`, `apps/api/src/identity/me.entitlements.service.ts`, `apps/portal/src/me/member-entitlements-bff.server.ts`, `apps/portal/src/me/member-entitlements-cache.server.ts`, `apps/portal/app/api/me/entitlements/route.ts`.

### 3.4 Home aggregate bootstrap (DL-19)

`buildMemberHomePayload` composes entitled module cards from effective registry + entitlements `granted`. Consumed by `/me/home` SSR and `GET /api/me/home`.

**Paths:** `apps/portal/src/me/member-home-bff.server.ts`, `apps/portal/app/api/me/home/route.ts`.

---

## 4. Error responses

| Status | When | Body |
| ------ | ---- | ---- |
| 401 | No session | `{ ok: false, code: "unauthorized" }` |
| 403 | Session tenant mismatch | `{ ok: false, code: "tenant_mismatch" }` |
| 502 | API upstream failure | `{ ok: false, code: "upstream_error" }` |

Deep link to unauthorized module (DL-21): in-portal 403 page — not marketing redirect.

**PS-6 (2026-07-05):** Static module pages (`/me/home`, `/me/registrations`, `/me/profile`, registration detail) wrap content in `MemberModuleEntitlementGate`; `/me/more` uses `MemberMoreHubEntitlementGate` (requires entitled secondary modules).

---

## 5. Cache policy (DL-17)

| Phase | BFF cache | Invalidation |
| ----- | --------- | ------------ |
| PS-5 / BP-5 launch | **TTL = 0** (no cache) | N/A |
| **PS-6 (shipped)** | Private **30s max** (`MEMBER_ENTITLEMENTS_BFF_CACHE_TTL_MS`) | Logout + profile PATCH clear session-scoped key; membership webhooks (BP-7) |
| BP-7 | Same TTL cap | Membership mutation webhooks |

**Rule:** API re-checks on mutation regardless of BFF cache. Response `Cache-Control`: `private, max-age={ttlSeconds}` when TTL &gt; 0; `no-store` when disabled.

### 5.1 Cache invalidation routes (PS-6)

| Route | Auth | Behavior |
| ----- | ---- | -------- |
| Logout | Session cookie clear | `invalidateMemberEntitlementsCacheForMember` |
| Profile PATCH | Member session | Same helper after successful upstream patch |
| `POST /api/me/entitlements/invalidate` | Member session (PCMS-SEC-01) | Explicit BFF cache bust — bootstrap for BP-7 billing webhooks |

BP-7 billing may call the same invalidation helper server-side after updating `portalModuleGrants`; external service auth is out of scope for PS-6 bootstrap.

---

## 6. Security assumptions

| Assumption | Enforcement |
| ---------- | ----------- |
| Decorative nav forbidden | SSR uses same entitlements fetch as client hydration |
| Operator finance never exposed | No `operator.*` keys in member entitlements |
| Tenant bind | PCMS-SEC-01 on all `/api/me/*` |
| M17 allowlist | `guard-public-catalog-m17` extended (DL-31) |

---

## 7. Future extensions

| Extension | Phase | Notes |
| --------- | ----- | ----- |
| Per-module capability flags | BP-7 | Sub-keys under `member.module.{id}.*` |
| Webhook invalidation | BP-7 | Membership plan changes |
| Plan tables / billing webhooks | BP-7 | Populate `portalModuleGrants` from subscription service |
| Membership mutation webhooks | BP-7 | `POST /api/me/entitlements/invalidate` (session-scoped, PS-6 bootstrap) |

### 7.1 Home aggregate (shipped bootstrap)

See §3.3 — `GET /api/me/home` live at `apps/portal/app/api/me/home/route.ts`.

